e campaigns on the roads in less than an hour and go live. It provides the option to upload and manage media, run smart campaigns, reach your audience, and view reports. All of this happens on a single dashboard, so it doesn\'t take an expert to use it.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"p4\\\"><span class=\\\"s2\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.brandsonroad.com\\/\\\">Jump on board<\\/a><\\/span><span class=\\\"s1\\\"> with us as we drive your brand to your customers. <\\/span><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(4144,139,'_elementor_page_assets','a:0:{}'),(4145,573,'_wp_attached_file','2020/11/0008.png'),(4146,573,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:5:{s:5:\"width\";i:1920;s:6:\"height\";i:720;s:4:\"file\";s:16:\"2020/11/0008.png\";s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:16:\"0008-300x113.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:113;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:5:\"large\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"0008-1024x384.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:384;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:16:\"0008-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:16:\"0008-768x288.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:288;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"0008-1536x576.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:1536;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:24:\"trp-custom-language-flag\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:13:\"0008-18x7.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:18;s:6:\"height\";i:7;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s: