eq_num','8'),(5884,781,'_field_1','Phailin Hongwiangjan '),(5885,781,'_field_5','0827056267'),(5886,781,'_field_2','samanta.mustard@gmail.com'),(5887,781,'_field_6','Foodpanda '),(5888,781,'_form_id','1'),(5889,781,'_seq_num','9'),(5890,782,'_field_1','Kota Takeuchi'),(5891,782,'_field_5','0902584036'),(5892,782,'_field_2','takeuchi@protocol.ooo'),(5893,782,'_field_6','To Whom It May Concern:  Hi!  My name is Kota Takeuchi, I’m the CEO of PROTOCOL Inc. I’d like to introduce to you our venture platform, founded by me and a Japanese soccer star - Keisuke Honda.  PROTOCOL is a platform connecting startups, investors and job-seekers from Asia and around the world. The β version of our product, released in 2021 as the investor matching service, has attracted users from more than 50 countries, making it the industry leader in Japan with the biggest number of users.  The current major update of the platform gives startups all they need in terms of fundraising and recruitment in one place.  New features include:  1. PRO Funding  Create, share &amp; analyse information for your next investment round.  Completely free to use! More details: https://profunding.protocol.ooo/en  2. HR Service  Post job openings &amp; conduct global search for employees.  Offered at the lowest price in the industry! An example of how you can post job openings: https://protocol.ooo/en/companies/playco-82d3484d-336d-4f0f-994c-4ba8075e0a9c/jobs/game-engineer-apac  If you’re looking for investors or professionals worldwide, join us using the link below: https://protocol.ooo/en/signup  Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.  Best regards,  ------------------------------- Kota Takeuchi, CEO PROTOCOL, Inc. 2-14-12 Iwamotocho, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo, Japan E-mail: takeuchi@protocol.ooo'),(5894,782,'_form_id','1'),(5895,782,'_seq_num','10'),(5896,783,'_field_1','ฟ้า'),(5897,783,'_field_5','0973386541'),(5898,783,'_field_2','phiyanart@khotcherglobalfood.com'),(5899,783,'_field_6','สวัสดีค่ะ สิ