2','itn.jiaxin.wong@grabtaxi.com'),(8328,1068,'_field_6','Dear Brands On Road, this is Jia Xin from the GrabAds Strategy &amp; Partnership team! At GrabAds, we connect advertisers with millions of people across Southeast Asia through both online and offline ad products.  Our team is currently looking at the potential to launch car wrap ads in Thailand and we understand that Brands On Road has the existing capability and expertise to do so. As such, we are excited to explore a potential partnership where we send our advertisers your way and subsequently place their ads on both of our supply of drivers. Would it be possible for us to have a call sometime next week to discuss and explore the possibility of a partnership? Looking forward to hearing from you soon!'),(8329,1068,'_form_id','1'),(8330,1068,'_seq_num','19'),(8331,1069,'_field_1','uts3eu2b29 <div> <a>k03tssj9vs</a></a> <a>rg4pms9ila</a></a> <a><b>wbxjwn19s5</b></a></div>'),(8332,1069,'_field_5','/#/CREO_EX2/#/'),(8333,1069,'_field_2','tewnlyw4@waterisgone.com'),(8334,1069,'_field_6','/#/CREO_EX4/#/'),(8335,1069,'_form_id','1'),(8336,1069,'_seq_num','20'),(8337,1070,'_field_1','Kt'),(8338,1070,'_field_5','6586865770'),(8339,1070,'_field_2','k@aximtrade.com'),(8340,1070,'_field_6','Hi would like to know more about your taxi solutions in bangkok. Please share with me more details. Thank you'),(8341,1070,'_form_id','1'),(8342,1070,'_seq_num','21'),(8343,1071,'_field_1','Woranat Boonpitak'),(8344,1071,'_field_5','+66818585323'),(8345,1071,'_field_2','bom.woranat@aximtrade.com'),(8346,1071,'_field_6','สนใจลงโฆษณาบนแท็กซี่ รบกวนติดต่อกลับด้วยครับ'),(8347,1071,'_form_id','1'),(8348,1071,'_seq_num','22'),(8349,1074,'_field_1','มิก'),(8350,1074,'_field_5','0614253366'),(8351,1074,'_field_2','mickey19448@gmail.com'),(8352,1074,'_field_6','ติดต่อโฆษณาบนรถแท็กซี่'),(8353,1074,'_form_id','1'),(8354,1074,'_seq_num','23'),(8355,1075,'_field_1','Kris Supavatanakul'),(8356,1075,'_field_5','0879110905'),(8357,1075,'_field_2','k