 campaigns and assess ad effectiveness in real-time. Being audience-centric, pDOOH helps them optimize their ad campaigns in the best ways possible.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n 	<li><b>Amplified brand messaging: </b>Programmatic DOOH advertising offers marketers a great amount of flexibility by enabling them to purchase inventory automatically. Imagine a cold coffee brand being able to get DOOH ads out immediately upon announcement of predicted rising temperatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Welcoming a programmatic DOOH future together with Brands On Road</b>\nBrands on Road is completely compatible with programmatic platforms to facilitate the most efficient purchase and delivery of ads. We gather and process information from a multitude of data points allowing brands to leverage a level of targeting and analytics that\'s not possible in traditional out-of-home advertising.&nbsp; With us, you can connect, monitor, and manage your DOOH campaigns from a single dashboard. Have you taken your brand to the roads of Bangkok yet? <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#feed-form\">Contact us</a> to get your ads moving today!&nbsp;','Programmatic DOOH: The Future of Outdoor Advertising','','inherit','closed','closed','','232-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:02:07','2022-02-01 07:02:07','',232,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=531',0,'revision','',0),(532,1,'2022-02-01 07:02:07','2022-02-01 07:02:07','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1920\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/0003-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/0003-1.png 1920w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/0003-1-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-c