spects surrounding programmatic DOOH advertising. Read on!&nbsp;\n<b>Meaning of programmatic DOOH&nbsp;</b>\nProgrammatic DOOH, also known as pDOOH, can be defined as the automated buying, selling, and delivery of out-of-home advertising. Automation is the most commonly understood feature of DOOH advertising. It allows advertisers to set the various conditions under which they want to buy media. As soon as those conditions are met, ads are purchased automatically. The best part about programmatic DOOH is that there is no cap on the types of data that can be leveraged to trigger the purchase of a particular DOOH ad slot. Thanks to its commendable speed and flexibility, programmatic DOOH allows brands to deliver the right message to the right audience at the right time. To put it simply, programmatic DOOH can be described as a refined version of digital-out-of-home advertising. Some of the most invaluable perks of programmatic DOOH are its data-driven targeting precision and agile purchase models.&nbsp;\n<b>Bring your ad campaigns to life with pDOOH&nbsp;</b>\nWith programmatic technologies, brands can supercharge their outdoor advertising initiatives. They help you deliver different types of ad creatives based on time, weather, market performance, and many other crucial factors. Let’s have a quick look at some of the best advantages of programmatic DOOH advertising.&nbsp;<b></b>\n<ul>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Contextual targeting</b>Programmatic tools create highly-targeted ad campaigns by utilizing geolocation data and activating the most efficient and effective DOOH screens in real-time. The ads are purely based on consumer behaviour and movement patterns.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n 	<li><b>Accurate campaign measurement: </b>Programmatic technologies allow marketers to efficiently customize their DOOH campaigns and assess ad effectiveness in real-time. Being audience-centric, pDOOH helps them optimize their ad campaigns in the best ways possible.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n 	<li><b>Amplified brand messaging: </b>Programmatic DOOH advertising offers marketers a great amount of flexibility by enabling them to purchase inventory automatically. Imagine a cold coffee brand being able to get DOOH ads out immediately upon announcement of predicted rising temperatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Welcoming a programmatic DOOH future together with Brands On Road</b>\nBrands on Road is completely compatible with programmatic platforms to facilitate the most efficient purchase and delivery of ads. We gather and process information from a multitude of data points allowing brands to leverage a level of targeting and analytics that\'s not possible in traditional out-of-home advertising.&nbsp; With us, you can connect, monitor, and manage your DOOH campaigns from a single dashboard. Have you taken your brand to the roads of Bangkok yet? <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#feed-form\">Contact us</a> to get your ads moving today!&nbsp;','Programmatic DOOH: The Future of Outdoor Advertising','','inherit','closed','closed','','232-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:02:07','2022-02-01 07:02:07','',232,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=533',0,'revision','',0),(535,1,'2022-02-01 07:06:13','2022-02-01 07:06:13','','0004','','inherit','open','closed','','0004-2','','','2022-02-01 07:06:13','2022-02-01 07:06:13','',216,'https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(536,1,'2022-02-01 07:08:46','2022-02-01 07:08:46','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bangkok is back to witnessing gridlock during peak hours as Covid measures ease across the city. It’s time that brands and marketers get ready to own the streets again with DOOH (Digital-Out-Of-Home) advertising. As per a Statista study, the global ad spending on DOOH is projected to rise to </span><a href=\"https://www.statista.com/statistics/272951/global-digital-out-of-home-advertising-expenditure-since-2000/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">15.9 billion US dollars </span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">by 2027. Thanks to new possibilities with DOOH, the road to recovery for OOH advertising is strong. In this article, we are going to discuss how DOOH technologies can work wonders for your brand in the present post-pandemic milieu.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>DOOH - The latest hit in the advertising sector in post-pandemic times!</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As audiences are becoming increasingly digitized, the pressure to conduct more personalized OOH campaigns is arising. And merging the digital-age technologies with OOH advertising can prove to be the best way to deliver your brand message to the right audience at the right time. Now that car and foot traffic is up again, brands can make the most of innovative DOOH ad campaigns involving contextual targeting.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH advertising has full potential to become central in the marketplace. Its unique format allows marketers to be flexible with when and where impressions are delivered to audiences. With brands demanding measurable data-backed results, programmatic DOOH enables advertisers to optimize their campaigns based on location targeting. It is, undoubtedly, one of the best ways to keep up with constantly changing market conditions.</span>\n<h4><b>A quick view of the best advantages of DOOH advertising</b></h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dynamic ad delivery&nbsp;</span></li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Data-enriched ad serving&nbsp;</span></li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Real-time reporting and analytics&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<b><i>Pro tip: </i></b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In a post-pandemic environment, you should make sure that your DOOH campaigns are hyper-targeted geographically, considering the varying unlocking plans across different locations in Bangkok.&nbsp;</span></i>\n<h3><b>Get your brand moving with us&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With Brands On Road, advertisers can mobilize their respective brands in an unmissable way by connecting with audiences in real-time via our taxi-top screens. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We take pride to inform you that our fleet of 233 screens delivered more than 15 million impressions with over 33,000+ hours of ad playtime in September 2021. Along with taxi-top screens, you can gain the best benefits of taxi wraps and our special social box feature that enables </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">in-car and pedestrian audiences to engage with your brand on their personal devices</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a ride with us and tell your captivating story to your potential customers as you move to different parts of the city throughout the day. Click </span><a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#feed-form\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to connect today.&nbsp;</span>','The resurgence of DOOH in post-pandemic Bangkok','','inherit','closed','closed','','216-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:08:46','2022-02-01 07:08:46','',216,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=536',0,'revision','',0),(537,1,'2022-02-01 07:08:47','2022-02-01 07:08:47','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bangkok is back to witnessing gridlock during peak hours as Covid measures ease across the city. It’s time that brands and marketers get ready to own the streets again with DOOH (Digital-Out-Of-Home) advertising. As per a Statista study, the global ad spending on DOOH is projected to rise to </span><a href=\"https://www.statista.com/statistics/272951/global-digital-out-of-home-advertising-expenditure-since-2000/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">15.9 billion US dollars </span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">by 2027. Thanks to new possibilities with DOOH, the road to recovery for OOH advertising is strong. In this article, we are going to discuss how DOOH technologies can work wonders for your brand in the present post-pandemic milieu.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>DOOH - The latest hit in the advertising sector in post-pandemic times!</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As audiences are becoming increasingly digitized, the pressure to conduct more personalized OOH campaigns is arising. And merging the digital-age technologies with OOH advertising can prove to be the best way to deliver your brand message to the right audience at the right time. Now that car and foot traffic is up again, brands can make the most of innovative DOOH ad campaigns involving contextual targeting.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH advertising has full potential to become central in the marketplace. Its unique format allows marketers to be flexible with when and where impressions are delivered to audiences. With brands demanding measurable data-backed results, programmatic DOOH enables advertisers to optimize their campaigns based on location targeting. It is, undoubtedly, one of the best ways to keep up with constantly changing market conditions.</span>\n<h4><b>A quick view of the best advantages of DOOH advertising</b></h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dynamic ad delivery&nbsp;</span></li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Data-enriched ad serving&nbsp;</span></li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Real-time reporting and analytics&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<b><i>Pro tip: </i></b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In a post-pandemic environment, you should make sure that your DOOH campaigns are hyper-targeted geographically, considering the varying unlocking plans across different locations in Bangkok.&nbsp;</span></i>\n<h3><b>Get your brand moving with us&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With Brands On Road, advertisers can mobilize their respective brands in an unmissable way by connecting with audiences in real-time via our taxi-top screens. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We take pride to inform you that our fleet of 233 screens delivered more than 15 million impressions with over 33,000+ hours of ad playtime in September 2021. Along with taxi-top screens, you can gain the best benefits of taxi wraps and our special social box feature that enables </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">in-car and pedestrian audiences to engage with your brand on their personal devices</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a ride with us and tell your captivating story to your potential customers as you move to different parts of the city throughout the day. Click </span><a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#feed-form\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to connect today.&nbsp;</span>','The resurgence of DOOH in post-pandemic Bangkok','','inherit','closed','closed','','216-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:08:47','2022-02-01 07:08:47','',216,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=537',0,'revision','',0),(538,1,'2022-02-01 07:08:47','2022-02-01 07:08:47','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"800\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-1024x384.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-1024x384.png 1024w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-768x288.png 768w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-1536x576.png 1536w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-18x7.png 18w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n		Bangkok is back to witnessing gridlock during peak hours as Covid measures ease across the city. It’s time that brands and marketers get ready to own the streets again with DOOH (Digital-Out-Of-Home) advertising. As per a Statista study, the global ad spending on DOOH is projected to rise to <a href=\"https://www.statista.com/statistics/272951/global-digital-out-of-home-advertising-expenditure-since-2000/\">15.9 billion US dollars </a>by 2027. Thanks to new possibilities with DOOH, the road to recovery for OOH advertising is strong. In this article, we are going to discuss how DOOH technologies can work wonders for your brand in the present post-pandemic milieu.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>DOOH - The latest hit in the advertising sector in post-pandemic times!</b></h3>\nAs audiences are becoming increasingly digitized, the pressure to conduct more personalized OOH campaigns is arising. And merging the digital-age technologies with OOH advertising can prove to be the best way to deliver your brand message to the right audience at the right time. Now that car and foot traffic is up again, brands can make the most of innovative DOOH ad campaigns involving contextual targeting.&nbsp;\nDOOH advertising has full potential to become central in the marketplace. Its unique format allows marketers to be flexible with when and where impressions are delivered to audiences. With brands demanding measurable data-backed results, programmatic DOOH enables advertisers to optimize their campaigns based on location targeting. It is, undoubtedly, one of the best ways to keep up with constantly changing market conditions.\n<h4><b>A quick view of the best advantages of DOOH advertising</b></h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Dynamic ad delivery&nbsp;</li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Data-enriched ad serving&nbsp;</li>\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Real-time reporting and analytics&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<b><i>Pro tip: </i></b><i>In a post-pandemic environment, you should make sure that your DOOH campaigns are hyper-targeted geographically, considering the varying unlocking plans across different locations in Bangkok.&nbsp;</i>\n<h3><b>Get your brand moving with us&nbsp;</b></h3>\nWith Brands On Road, advertisers can mobilize their respective brands in an unmissable way by connecting with audiences in real-time via our taxi-top screens. We take pride to inform you that our fleet of 233 screens delivered more than 15 million impressions with over 33,000+ hours of ad playtime in September 2021. Along with taxi-top screens, you can gain the best benefits of taxi wraps and our special social box feature that enables in-car and pedestrian audiences to engage with your brand on their personal devices. Take a ride with us and tell your captivating story to your potential customers as you move to different parts of the city throughout the day. Click <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#feed-form\">here</a> to connect today.&nbsp;','The resurgence of DOOH in post-pandemic Bangkok','','inherit','closed','closed','','216-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:08:47','2022-02-01 07:08:47','',216,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=538',0,'revision','',0),(541,1,'2022-02-01 07:13:44','2022-02-01 07:13:44','','0005','','inherit','open','closed','','0005','','','2022-02-01 07:13:44','2022-02-01 07:13:44','',211,'https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(542,1,'2022-02-01 07:16:01','2022-02-01 07:16:01','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Out-of-home advertising has surely taken a backseat given the pandemic situation across the globe. But with the growing popularity of digital inventories, there’s still a silver lining for brands to strategically place their ad campaigns in the public. Brands can utilize the increased opportunity that comes with the smart integration of digital approaches to connect smartly with their audience. In this article, we shall discuss how brands can benefit from the consistent expansions of digital tools and DOOH advertising during the pandemic.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Stay on top of your AD campaigns with DOOH technology-based approaches&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH can provide brands with immense flexibility to deliver meaningful ad campaigns in the present social-distant environment.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let’s try to comprehend this by taking the example of a restaurant business. In case of partial lockdown scenarios,&nbsp; restaurant businesses can leverage DOOH to let customers know that they have started dine-in options and follow all Covid guidelines to ensure customer safety. DOOH campaigns can be great mediums for making brand announcements in public. Be it restaurants, local supermarkets, or any other business entity,&nbsp; all of them can come up with their unique ad content to stay relevant in the market.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Advertisers can also tweak their ad content to fit into surrounding situations. Maybe, a creative can display a Covid-friendly message from a&nbsp; brand to highlight a concern for their audience.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As digital has turned the new normal now, DOOH advertising has full potential to garner audience attention in a closed environment. With lockdowns slowly phasing out, digital displays like our taxi-top LED screens can help brands connect efficiently with their audience in a contactless milieu.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>How DOOH advertising with Brands On Road can take your brand awareness to the next level during the pandemic?&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The pandemic has spurred the outdoor advertising industry to invest in technologies that can establish contactless communication experiences with audiences. We, at Brands On Road, can help you achieve the same. By utilizing our geo-targeting capabilities, brands can reach locations that are more likely to see traffic. We support efficient programmatic DOOH tools to interact with the audience in real-time. With a live feed of key performance metrics, brands can evaluate the effectiveness of their ad campaigns.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Moreover, our programmatic DOOH techniques can help brands push the movement of ads to where audience presence is the most. With digital advancements garnering attention more than ever, brands can re-innovate their ad strategies to fit into the changing consumer behavior patterns.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a ride with </span><a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#aboutus\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Brands On Road </span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">to leverage smart DOOH technologies and witness the best campaign outcomes for your brand.&nbsp;</span>\n\n&nbsp;','Why DOOH advertising during the pandemic might not be a bad idea','','inherit','closed','closed','','211-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:16:01','2022-02-01 07:16:01','',211,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=542',0,'revision','',0),(543,1,'2022-02-01 07:16:01','2022-02-01 07:16:01','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Out-of-home advertising has surely taken a backseat given the pandemic situation across the globe. But with the growing popularity of digital inventories, there’s still a silver lining for brands to strategically place their ad campaigns in the public. Brands can utilize the increased opportunity that comes with the smart integration of digital approaches to connect smartly with their audience. In this article, we shall discuss how brands can benefit from the consistent expansions of digital tools and DOOH advertising during the pandemic.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Stay on top of your AD campaigns with DOOH technology-based approaches&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH can provide brands with immense flexibility to deliver meaningful ad campaigns in the present social-distant environment.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let’s try to comprehend this by taking the example of a restaurant business. In case of partial lockdown scenarios,&nbsp; restaurant businesses can leverage DOOH to let customers know that they have started dine-in options and follow all Covid guidelines to ensure customer safety. DOOH campaigns can be great mediums for making brand announcements in public. Be it restaurants, local supermarkets, or any other business entity,&nbsp; all of them can come up with their unique ad content to stay relevant in the market.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Advertisers can also tweak their ad content to fit into surrounding situations. Maybe, a creative can display a Covid-friendly message from a&nbsp; brand to highlight a concern for their audience.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As digital has turned the new normal now, DOOH advertising has full potential to garner audience attention in a closed environment. With lockdowns slowly phasing out, digital displays like our taxi-top LED screens can help brands connect efficiently with their audience in a contactless milieu.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>How DOOH advertising with Brands On Road can take your brand awareness to the next level during the pandemic?&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The pandemic has spurred the outdoor advertising industry to invest in technologies that can establish contactless communication experiences with audiences. We, at Brands On Road, can help you achieve the same. By utilizing our geo-targeting capabilities, brands can reach locations that are more likely to see traffic. We support efficient programmatic DOOH tools to interact with the audience in real-time. With a live feed of key performance metrics, brands can evaluate the effectiveness of their ad campaigns.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Moreover, our programmatic DOOH techniques can help brands push the movement of ads to where audience presence is the most. With digital advancements garnering attention more than ever, brands can re-innovate their ad strategies to fit into the changing consumer behavior patterns.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a ride with </span><a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#aboutus\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Brands On Road </span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">to leverage smart DOOH technologies and witness the best campaign outcomes for your brand.&nbsp;</span>\n\n&nbsp;','Why DOOH advertising during the pandemic might not be a bad idea','','inherit','closed','closed','','211-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:16:01','2022-02-01 07:16:01','',211,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=543',0,'revision','',0),(544,1,'2022-02-01 07:16:02','2022-02-01 07:16:02','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1920\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005.png 1920w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005-1024x384.png 1024w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005-768x288.png 768w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005-1536x576.png 1536w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005-18x7.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />															\n		Out-of-home advertising has surely taken a backseat given the pandemic situation across the globe. But with the growing popularity of digital inventories, there’s still a silver lining for brands to strategically place their ad campaigns in the public. Brands can utilize the increased opportunity that comes with the smart integration of digital approaches to connect smartly with their audience. In this article, we shall discuss how brands can benefit from the consistent expansions of digital tools and DOOH advertising during the pandemic.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Stay on top of your AD campaigns with DOOH technology-based approaches&nbsp;</b></h3>\nDOOH can provide brands with immense flexibility to deliver meaningful ad campaigns in the present social-distant environment.&nbsp;Let’s try to comprehend this by taking the example of a restaurant business. In case of partial lockdown scenarios,&nbsp; restaurant businesses can leverage DOOH to let customers know that they have started dine-in options and follow all Covid guidelines to ensure customer safety. DOOH campaigns can be great mediums for making brand announcements in public. Be it restaurants, local supermarkets, or any other business entity,&nbsp; all of them can come up with their unique ad content to stay relevant in the market.&nbsp;\nAdvertisers can also tweak their ad content to fit into surrounding situations. Maybe, a creative can display a Covid-friendly message from a&nbsp; brand to highlight a concern for their audience.&nbsp;\nAs digital has turned the new normal now, DOOH advertising has full potential to garner audience attention in a closed environment. With lockdowns slowly phasing out, digital displays like our taxi-top LED screens can help brands connect efficiently with their audience in a contactless milieu.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>How DOOH advertising with Brands On Road can take your brand awareness to the next level during the pandemic?&nbsp;</b></h3>\nThe pandemic has spurred the outdoor advertising industry to invest in technologies that can establish contactless communication experiences with audiences. We, at Brands On Road, can help you achieve the same. By utilizing our geo-targeting capabilities, brands can reach locations that are more likely to see traffic. We support efficient programmatic DOOH tools to interact with the audience in real-time. With a live feed of key performance metrics, brands can evaluate the effectiveness of their ad campaigns.&nbsp;\nMoreover, our programmatic DOOH techniques can help brands push the movement of ads to where audience presence is the most. With digital advancements garnering attention more than ever, brands can re-innovate their ad strategies to fit into the changing consumer behavior patterns.&nbsp;\nTake a ride with <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#aboutus\">Brands On Road </a>to leverage smart DOOH technologies and witness the best campaign outcomes for your brand.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;','Why DOOH advertising during the pandemic might not be a bad idea','','inherit','closed','closed','','211-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:16:02','2022-02-01 07:16:02','',211,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=544',0,'revision','',0),(546,1,'2022-02-01 07:23:17','2022-02-01 07:23:17','','0006','','inherit','open','closed','','0006','','','2022-02-01 07:23:17','2022-02-01 07:23:17','',204,'https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(547,1,'2022-02-01 07:24:33','2022-02-01 07:24:33','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Elimination of third-party cookies - Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.&nbsp;</span>\n<h4><b>DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers. </b></h4>\n<b></b>In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.&nbsp;</span>\n<h4><b>DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies</b></h4>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.&nbsp;</span><b></b>\n<h4><b>DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising&nbsp;</b></h4>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F\">Brands On Road</a>, we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH. </span>','The future of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world','','inherit','closed','closed','','204-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:24:33','2022-02-01 07:24:33','',204,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=547',0,'revision','',0),(548,1,'2022-02-01 07:24:34','2022-02-01 07:24:34','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Elimination of third-party cookies - Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.&nbsp;</span>\n<h4><b>DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers. </b></h4>\n<b></b>In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.&nbsp;</span>\n<h4><b>DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies</b></h4>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.&nbsp;</span><b></b>\n<h4><b>DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising&nbsp;</b></h4>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F\">Brands On Road</a>, we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.&nbsp;</span>\n<h3><b>A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!&nbsp;</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH. </span>','The future of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world','','inherit','closed','closed','','204-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:24:34','2022-02-01 07:24:34','',204,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=548',0,'revision','',0),(549,1,'2022-02-01 07:24:34','2022-02-01 07:24:34','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1920\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png 1920w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1024x384.png 1024w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-768x288.png 768w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1536x576.png 1536w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-18x7.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />															\n		The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Elimination of third-party cookies - Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?&nbsp;</b></h3>\nIt is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.&nbsp;\nIn cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.&nbsp;\nAt Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu&nbsp;</b></h3>\nLet us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers. </b></h4>\n<b></b>In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location. Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies</b></h4>\nDOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.&nbsp;<b></b>\n<h4><b>DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising&nbsp;</b></h4>\nThere are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.&nbsp; At <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F\">Brands On Road</a>, we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!&nbsp;</b></h3>\nWith DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\nIt’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH.','The future of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world','','inherit','closed','closed','','204-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:24:34','2022-02-01 07:24:34','',204,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=549',0,'revision','',0),(550,1,'2022-02-01 07:24:54','2022-02-01 07:24:54','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1920\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png 1920w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1024x384.png 1024w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-768x288.png 768w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1536x576.png 1536w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-18x7.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />															\n		The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Elimination of third-party cookies - Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?&nbsp;</b></h3>\nIt is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.&nbsp;\nIn cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.&nbsp;\nAt Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu&nbsp;</b></h3>\nLet us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers. </b></h4>\n<b></b>In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location. Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies</b></h4>\nDOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.&nbsp;<b></b>\n<h4><b>DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising&nbsp;</b></h4>\nThere are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.&nbsp; At <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F\">Brands On Road</a>, we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!&nbsp;</b></h3>\nWith DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\nIt’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH.','The future of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world','','inherit','closed','closed','','204-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:24:54','2022-02-01 07:24:54','',204,'https://brandsonroad.com//?p=550',0,'revision','',0),(551,1,'2022-02-01 07:24:54','2022-02-01 07:24:54','<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1920\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png 1920w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-300x113.png 300w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1024x384.png 1024w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-768x288.png 768w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-1536x576.png 1536w, https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006-18x7.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />															\n		The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Elimination of third-party cookies - Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?&nbsp;</b></h3>\nIt is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.&nbsp;\nIn cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.&nbsp;\nAt Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu&nbsp;</b></h3>\nLet us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers. </b></h4>\n<b></b>In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location. Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.&nbsp;\n<h4><b>DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies</b></h4>\nDOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.&nbsp;<b></b>\n<h4><b>DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising&nbsp;</b></h4>\nThere are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.&nbsp; At <a href=\"https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F\">Brands On Road</a>, we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.&nbsp;\n<h3><b>A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!&nbsp;</b></h3>\nWith DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.&nbsp;\nIt’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH.','The future of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world','','inherit','closed','closed','','204-revision-v1','','','2022-02-01 07:24:54','2022-02-01 07:24:54','',204,'https://brandso