oads/2022/01/Group-164.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h5>CAPTIVE SCREENS</h5>		\n		<p>Run your own ads on your screen 24 x 7 and manage your campaigns in real time on the Brands on Road platform.</p>		\n															<img width=\"168\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Group-166.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h5>PASSIVE REVENUE</h5>		\n		<p>Brands on Road manages the technology and customers while you get a share of all third-party advertising spend on your screen.</p>		\n															<img width=\"160\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Group-168.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h5>DATA ACCESS</h5>		\n		<p>With a multitude of data collection points and sensors built into the platform, you get access to detailed user insights and actionable data sets.</p>		\n															<img width=\"204\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com//wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Group-170.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h5>FLEET MANAGEMENT</h5>		\n		<p>Get real time location and data of your taxi fleet (including active time and distance travelled). Manage them through a single dashboard.</p>		\n			<h1>Thailand’s first Digital OOH company <br>providing top mounted LED screens</h1>		\n		<p>Want to know more?</p>		\n			<a href=\"/#Contact\" role=\"button\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n			<h2>Get your brand moving today!</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */\n.elementor-widget-social-icons.elementor-grid-0 .elementor-widget-container,.elementor-widget-social-icons.elementor-grid-mobile-0 .elementor-widget-container,.elementor-widget-social-icons.elementor-grid-tablet-0 .elementor-widget-container{line-height:1;font-size:0}.elementor-widget-social-icons:not(.elementor-grid-0):not(.elementor-grid-tablet-0):not(.elementor-grid-mobile-0) .elementor-grid{display:inline-grid}.elementor-widget-social-