	\n			<figure><img width=\"75\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/second.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Trackable</h4><p>Connect, monitor, and manage your campaigns from a single Dashboard</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"68\" height=\"68\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/cost.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Cost Effective</h4><p>Run multiple ads & campaigns across the city in a single budget</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"70\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/hand.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Flexible</h4><p>Control campaign schedules & directly publish ads on our screens</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"76\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/unique.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Unique</h4><p>The first and largest fleet of taxi-top LED screens in Thailand</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"72\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/hands.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Always Available </h4><p>Always Available Consult our team of experts for recommendations based on your objectives</p>		\n															<img width=\"85\" height=\"43\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Color.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h2>How it Works?</h2>		\n															<img width=\"64\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Quick Sign Up</strong> – A quick meet &amp; greet, fast onboarding, easy to understand tutorials, and you’re done! Upload your content and go live on our screens in as little as 30 minutes.</p>		\n															<img width=\"95\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon02.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Single Dashboard</strong> – Manage all your DOOH ad campaigns live from a single online dashboard, providing a 360° view to initiate and manage campaigns.</p>		\n															<img width=\"90\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon03.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Upload &amp; Manage Content</strong> – Run a variety of content. Videos, Still Images and GIFs, all on a single platform.</p>		\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon04.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Run Smart Campaigns</strong> – Target based on Geo-location, Peak and Off-Peak Hours, Peak and Off-Peak Locations, and much more. Get real time analytics and obtain the Highest ROI for your campaigns.</p>		\n															<img width=\"93\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon05.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Reach Your Audience</strong> – Increase the number of ad views with the ability to run content parallelly at multiple locations, targeting and captivating on-road audiences and pedestrians.</p>		\n															<img width=\"75\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon06.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p><strong>Manage Multiple Cities</strong> – Run campaigns across multiple cities, all managed from your single dashboard and powered by real time ad statistics.</p>		\n			<h2>OWN A SCREEN</h2>		\n		<p>Get your own fleet of moving screens on</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://brandsonroad.brandsonroad.com/ow/\" role=\"button\">\n						Read More\n					</a>\n			<h2>Get your brand moving today!</h2>		\n		[ninja_form id=1]	<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>กดคลิ๊กโทรเลย</strong></h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"tel:0615061533\"><strong>081-493-9788</strong></a></h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">