383,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/unique.png'),(384,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/hands.png'),(385,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon01.png'),(386,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon02.png'),(387,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon03.png'),(388,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon04.png'),(389,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon05.png'),(390,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/icon06.png'),(391,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/plugins/wpfront-scroll-top/images/icons/114.png'),(392,'https://brandsonroad.brandsonroad.com/ow/'),(393,'Your privacy is important to us. It is Saraff Infotech Co., Ltd.&#8217;s policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect from you across our website, https://brandsonroad.com, and other sites we own and operate.'),(394,'We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent. We also let you know why we’re collecting it and how it will be used.'),(395,'We only retain collected information for as long as necessary to provide you with your requested service. What data we store, we’ll protect within commercially acceptable means to prevent loss and theft, as well as unauthorized access, disclosure, copying, use or modification.'),(396,'We don’t share any personally identifying information publicly or with third-parties, except when required to by law.'),(397,'Our website may link to external sites that are not operated by us. Please be aware that we have no control over the content and practices of these sites, and cannot accept responsibility or liability for their respective privacy policies.'),(398,'You are free to refuse our request for your personal information, with the understanding that we may be unable to provide you with some of your desired services.'),(399,'Your continued use of our website will be regarded as acceptance of our practices around privacy and personal information. If you have any questions about how we handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us.'),(400,'This policy is effective as of 1 Feb 2022.'),(401,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Blog-1.png'),(402,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/blog-2.png'),(403,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/blog-3.png'),(404,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/blog-4.png'),(405,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/blog-5.png'),(406,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/blog-6.png'),(407,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/blog-7.png'),(408,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/blog-8.png'),(409,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/blog-9.png'),(410,'Last updated 1 Feb 2022'),(411,'INTRODUCTION'),(412,'Saraff Infotech Co., Ltd. may use cookies, web beacons, tracking pixels, and other tracking technologies when you visit our website'),(413,'https://brandsonroad.brandsonroad.com/'),(414,', including any other media form, media channel, mobile website, or mobile application related or connected thereto (collectively, the “Site”) to help customize the Site and improve your experience.'),(415,'We reserve the right to make changes to this Cookie Policy at any time and for any reason. We will alert you about any changes by updating the “Last Updated” date of this Cookie Policy. Any changes or modifications will be effective immediately upon posting the updated Cookie Policy on the Site, and you waive the right to receive specific notice of each such change or modification.'),(416,'You are encouraged to periodically review this Cookie Policy to stay informed of updates. You will be deemed to have been made aware of, will be subject to, and will be deemed to have accepted the changes in any revised Cookie Policy by your continued use of the Site after the date such revised Cookie Policy is posted.'),(417,'USE OF COOKIES'),(418,'A “cookie” is a string of information which assigns you a unique identifier that we store on your computer. Your browser then provides that unique identifier to use each time you submit a query to the Site. We use cookies on the Site to, among other things, keep track of services you have used, record registration information, record your user preferences, keep you logged into the Site, facilitate purchase procedures, and track the pages you visit. Cookies help us understand how the Site is being used and improve your user experience.'),(419,'TYPES OF COOKIES'),(420,'The following types of cookies may be used when you visit the Site:'),(421,'Advertising Cookies'),(422,'Advertising cookies are placed on your computer by advertisers and ad servers in order to display advertisements that are most likely to be of interest to you. These cookies allow advertisers and ad servers to gather information about your visits to the Site and other websites, alternate the ads sent to a specific computer, and track how often an ad has been viewed and by whom. These cookies are linked to a computer and do not gather any personal information about you.'),(423,'Analytics Cookies'),(424,'Analytics cookies monitor how users reached the Site, and how they interact with and move around once on the Site. These cookies let us know what features on the Site are working the best and what features on the Site can be improved.'),(425,'Our Cookies'),(426,'Our cookies are “first-party cookies”, and can be either permanent or temporary. These are necessary cookies, without which the Site won’t work properly or be able to provide certain features and functionalities. Some of these may be manually disabled in your browser, but may affect the functionality of the Site.'),(427,'Personalization Cookies'),(428,'Personalization cookies are used to recognize repeat visitors to the Site. We use these cookies to record your browsing history, the pages you have visited, and your settings and preferences each time you visit the Site.'),(429,'Security Cookies'),(430,'Security cookies help identify and prevent security risks. We use these cookies to authenticate users and protect user data from unauthorized parties.'),(431,'Site Management Cookies'),(432,'Site management cookies are used to maintain your identity or session on the Site so that you are not logged off unexpectedly, and any information you enter is retained from page to page. These cookies cannot be turned off individually, but you can disable all cookies in your browser.'),(433,'Third-Party Cookies'),(434,'Third-party cookies may be placed on your computer when you visit the Site by companies that run certain services we offer. These cookies allow the third parties to gather and track certain information about you. These cookies can be manually disabled in your browser.'),(435,'CONTROL OF COOKIES'),(436,'Most browsers are set to accept cookies by default. However, you can remove or reject cookies in your browser’s settings. Please be aware that such action could affect the availability and functionality of the Site. For more information on how to control cookies, check your browser or device’s settings for how you can control or reject cookies, or visit the following links:'),(437,'Apple Safari'),(438,'Google Chrome'),(439,'Microsoft Edge'),(440,'Microsoft Internet Explorer'),(441,'Mozilla Firefox'),(442,'Opera'),(443,'Android (Chrome)'),(444,'Blackberry'),(445,'Iphone or Ipad (Chrome)'),(446,'Iphone or Ipad (Safari)'),(447,'In addition, you may opt-out of some third-party cookies through the'),(448,'Network Advertising Initiative’s Opt-Out Tool'),(449,'OTHER TRACKING TECHNOLOGIES'),(450,'In addition to cookies, we may use web beacons, pixel tags, and other tracking technologies on the Site to help customize the Site and improve your experience. A “web beacon” or “pixel tag” is a tiny object or image embedded in a web page or email. They are used to track the number of users who have visited particular pages and viewed emails, and acquire other statistical data. They collect only a limited set of data, such as a cookie number, time and date of page or email view, and a description of the page or email on which they reside. Web beacons and pixel tags cannot be declined. However, you can limit their use by controlling the cookies that interact with them.'),(451,'PRIVACY POLICY'),(452,'For more information about how we use information collected by cookies and other tracking technologies, please refer to our Privacy Policy posted on the Site. This Cookie Policy is part of and is incorporated into our Privacy Policy. By using the Site, you agree to be bound by this Cookie Policy and our Privacy Policy.'),(453,'CONTACT US'),(454,'If you have questions or comments about this Cookie Policy, please contact us at:'),(455,'Saraff Infotech Co., Ltd.'),(456,'S.V. City, 898/42, Tower 2, 24th Floor, Rama 3 Road,'),(457,'Bangpongpang, Yannawa, Bangkok, Thailand'),(458,'marketing.sil@saraffglobal.com'),(459,'https://support.apple.com/en-in/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac'),(460,'https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop&hl=en'),(461,'https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/microsoft-edge-browsing-data-and-privacy-bb8174ba-9d73-dcf2-9b4a-c582b4e640dd'),(462,'https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/windows/delete-and-manage-cookies-168dab11-0753-043d-7c16-ede5947fc64d'),(463,'https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop?redirectslug=enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences&redirectlocale=en-US'),(464,'https://help.opera.com/en/latest/'),(465,'https://docs.blackberry.com/content/dam/docs-blackberry-com/release-pdfs/en/device-user-guides/BlackBerry-Classic-Smartphone-10.3.3-User-Guide-en.pdf'),(466,'https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?co=GENIE.Platform%3DiOS&hl=en&oco=1'),(467,'https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?co=GENIE.Platform%3DAndroid&hl=en&oco=1'),(468,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/cookies-policy/?preview_id=90&preview_nonce=29de42b77b&_thumbnail_id=-1&preview=true'),(469,'mailto:marketing.sil@saraffglobal.com'),(470,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/0003-1.png'),(471,'Bangkok is back to witnessing gridlock during peak hours as Covid measures ease across the city. It’s time that brands and marketers get ready to own the streets again with DOOH (Digital-Out-Of-Home) advertising. As per a Statista study, the global ad spending on DOOH is projected to rise to'),(472,'15.9 billion US dollars'),(473,'by 2027. Thanks to new possibilities with DOOH, the road to recovery for OOH advertising is strong. In this article, we are going to discuss how DOOH technologies can work wonders for your brand in the present post-pandemic milieu.'),(474,'DOOH &#8211; The latest hit in the advertising sector in post-pandemic times!'),(475,'As audiences are becoming increasingly digitized, the pressure to conduct more personalized OOH campaigns is arising. And merging the digital-age technologies with OOH advertising can prove to be the best way to deliver your brand message to the right audience at the right time. Now that car and foot traffic is up again, brands can make the most of innovative DOOH ad campaigns involving contextual targeting.'),(476,'DOOH advertising has full potential to become central in the marketplace. Its unique format allows marketers to be flexible with when and where impressions are delivered to audiences. With brands demanding measurable data-backed results, programmatic DOOH enables advertisers to optimize their campaigns based on location targeting. It is, undoubtedly, one of the best ways to keep up with constantly changing market conditions.'),(477,'A quick view of the best advantages of DOOH advertising'),(478,'Dynamic ad delivery'),(479,'Data-enriched ad serving'),(480,'Real-time reporting and analytics'),(481,'Pro tip:'),(482,'In a post-pandemic environment, you should make sure that your DOOH campaigns are hyper-targeted geographically, considering the varying unlocking plans across different locations in Bangkok.'),(483,'Get your brand moving with us'),(484,'With Brands On Road, advertisers can mobilize their respective brands in an unmissable way by connecting with audiences in real-time via our taxi-top screens.'),(485,'We take pride to inform you that our fleet of 233 screens delivered more than 15 million impressions with over 33,000+ hours of ad playtime in September 2021. Along with taxi-top screens, you can gain the best benefits of taxi wraps and our special social box feature that enables'),(486,'in-car and pedestrian audiences to engage with your brand on their personal devices'),(487,'Take a ride with us and tell your captivating story to your potential customers as you move to different parts of the city throughout the day. Click'),(488,'here'),(489,'to connect today.'),(490,'DOOH ad'),(491,'DOOH advertising'),(492,'DOOH in Bangkok'),(493,'DOOH Technologies'),(494,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/0004-1024x384.png'),(495,'https://www.statista.com/statistics/272951/global-digital-out-of-home-advertising-expenditure-since-2000/'),(496,'Out-of-home advertising has surely taken a backseat given the pandemic situation across the globe. But with the growing popularity of digital inventories, there’s still a silver lining for brands to strategically place their ad campaigns in the public. Brands can utilize the increased opportunity that comes with the smart integration of digital approaches to connect smartly with their audience. In this article, we shall discuss how brands can benefit from the consistent expansions of digital tools and DOOH advertising during the pandemic.'),(497,'Stay on top of your AD campaigns with DOOH technology-based approaches'),(498,'DOOH can provide brands with immense flexibility to deliver meaningful ad campaigns in the present social-distant environment.'),(499,'Let’s try to comprehend this by taking the example of a restaurant business. In case of partial lockdown scenarios,&nbsp; restaurant businesses can leverage DOOH to let customers know that they have started dine-in options and follow all Covid guidelines to ensure customer safety. DOOH campaigns can be great mediums for making brand announcements in public. Be it restaurants, local supermarkets, or any other business entity,&nbsp; all of them can come up with their unique ad content to stay relevant in the market.'),(500,'Advertisers can also tweak their ad content to fit into surrounding situations. Maybe, a creative can display a Covid-friendly message from a&nbsp; brand to highlight a concern for their audience.'),(501,'As digital has turned the new normal now, DOOH advertising has full potential to garner audience attention in a closed environment. With lockdowns slowly phasing out, digital displays like our taxi-top LED screens can help brands connect efficiently with their audience in a contactless milieu.'),(502,'How DOOH advertising with Brands On Road can take your brand awareness to the next level during the pandemic?'),(503,'The pandemic has spurred the outdoor advertising industry to invest in technologies that can establish contactless communication experiences with audiences. We, at Brands On Road, can help you achieve the same. By utilizing our geo-targeting capabilities, brands can reach locations that are more likely to see traffic. We support efficient programmatic DOOH tools to interact with the audience in real-time. With a live feed of key performance metrics, brands can evaluate the effectiveness of their ad campaigns.'),(504,'Moreover, our programmatic DOOH techniques can help brands push the movement of ads to where audience presence is the most. With digital advancements garnering attention more than ever, brands can re-innovate their ad strategies to fit into the changing consumer behavior patterns.'),(505,'Take a ride with'),(506,'Brands On Road'),(507,'to leverage smart DOOH technologies and witness the best campaign outcomes for your brand.'),(508,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0005.png'),(509,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/#aboutus'),(510,'IoT and AI have given way to more creativity and greater expansion of the digital advertising industry. Let us discuss how they play an important role in changing the future of Digital Out Of Home Advertising.&nbsp; Marching towards smarter digital OOH innovations with IoT and AI&nbsp; &nbsp; The constant technical advancements have encouraged better development [&hellip;]'),(511,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/blog-6-1024x683.png'),(512,'IoT and AI have given way to more creativity and greater expansion of the digital advertising industry. Let us discuss how they play an important role in changing the future of Digital Out Of Home Advertising.'),(513,'Marching towards smarter digital OOH innovations with IoT and AI'),(514,'The constant technical advancements have encouraged better development of Digital Out Of Home Advertising. They help you reach a wider audience and deliver real-time content. AI helps you target the right person at the right time while IoT helps you innovate smarter DOOH ads.'),(515,'IoT technologies'),(516,'give you a sneak peek into real-time analytics and performance of your business. They have cleared the way to more innovations in the advertising industry.'),(517,'With IoT and AI, you can level up your digital'),(518,'out of home advertising'),(519,'game. You can monitor and track impressions without hassles. We feel glad to mention that we were able to generate around 19 million impressions for our customers in April 2021. Thanks to IoT and AI, digitalization is constantly merging with the physical world.'),(520,'At'),(521,'Brands On Road,'),(522,'we have leveraged both IoT and AI to give your DOOH advertising the most innovative approach. We are Thailand’s first digital OOH company. We provide the best taxi-based advertising solutions that help you run your ads parallely at multiple locations. With us, you can target your on road audiences in the best possible ways. What are you waiting for?'),(523,'Connect with us today.'),(524,'How IoT and AI will play a major role in changing the future of DOOH?'),(525,'Studies indicate that the'),(526,'IoT market will reach $142 billion by 2026 at a CAGR of 17%.'),(527,'With IoT connectivity, you can unlock unlimited advantages for your DOOH campaigns. The use of'),(528,'IoT in DOOH'),(529,'is on the rise and has paved the way for smooth customer engagement. IoT and AI hold great potential for the future of the DOOH industry. You can utilize them to design programmatic technologies. They will help your customers connect to your brand with the help of a QR code. With this, your brand’s performance can be monitored real-time.'),(530,'Brands On Road can help obtain the highest ROI for your advertising campaigns. We utilize geo-targeting technologies to identify the best areas that can help boost your brand awareness efforts. We have an in-car social box via which your audience can engage with your brand on their personal devices. Thus,'),(531,'IoT'),(532,'connectivity and'),(533,'AI'),(534,'practices are a great boon when it comes to enhancing your'),(535,'DOOH'),(536,'advertising game.'),(537,'Such kind of smart and innovative integrations enable you to analyze data in-depth and design your ads by mapping to your customer’s unique needs.'),(538,'Artificial Intelligence also plays an important role in transforming the digital outdoor advertising industry. It is turning digital signage more innovative. AI ensures that you make the right ad placement at the right time.'),(539,'We can help you outsmart your competition by leveraging the latest IoT and AI technologies. You can run campaigns across multiple cities and manage all of them from a single dashboard. Powered by real-time ad statistics, our DOOH model can help you beef up your customer engagement strategies.'),(540,'Get in touch with us'),(541,'Let IoT and AI advancements take your branding goals to the next level. Keeping up with the latest can help you move faster towards your growth.'),(542,'Brands on Road'),(543,'Digital Out Of Home Advertising'),(544,'DOOH Trends'),(545,'Internet Of Things'),(546,'OOH in Bangkok'),(547,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/0001.png'),(548,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/IOT-300x200.jpg'),(549,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/shutterstock_1684177678-300x169.jpg'),(550,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/'),(551,'https://dataprot.net/statistics/iot-statistics/'),(552,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/#whybransonroad'),(553,'Did you know Bangkok was marked the world’s 10th most traffic-congested city in 2020? Studies show that commuters in Bangkok spend more than 60 hours in road traffic annually. So why not leverage the traffic factor to level up your communication game with your potential audience?&nbsp; Yes, you heard it right. DOOH in Bangkok can [&hellip;]'),(554,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/blog-8-1024x683.png'),(555,'The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out [&hellip;]'),(556,'In the present fast-paced digital world, it is essential to keep coming up with innovative campaign ideas to attract your audiences’ attention. At Brands On Road, we aim to help you generate customer engagements via unique and creative DOOH campaigns. In this article, we shall discuss the best innovative DOOH campaign ideas that can help [&hellip;]'),(557,'In today&#8217;s fast-paced age, the right balance for most advertised lies the mixture of traditional and digital advertising. Brands on Road does precisely that when it comes to Out of Home Advertising. It is an advertising platform that empowers brands through technologies that traditional out of home advertising do not provide. Brands on Road is [&hellip;]'),(558,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/blog-4-1024x683.png'),(559,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/blog-5-1024x683.png'),(560,'In the present fast-paced milieu, almost everything is turning digital. According to the Gartner Report, around 91% of the organizations are involved in some kind of digital initiative. It is undeniable that the advertising industry has undergone a dramatic digital transformation. Out Of Home advertising remains one of the most traditional forms of advertising. The [&hellip;]'),(561,'ขออภัย คุณไม่ได้รับอนุญาตให้ดูฉบับร่างก่อน'),(562,'In the present fast-paced digital world, it is essential to keep coming up with innovative campaign ideas to attract your audiences’ attention. At Brands On Road, we aim to help you generate customer engagements via unique and creative DOOH campaigns. In this article, we shall discuss the best innovative DOOH campaign ideas that can help your brand outshine all the other competition in the congested roads of Bangkok.'),(563,'Build up your advertising goals with our exceptional campaign ideas'),(564,'Innovation helps you gain a competitive advantage and stand out from the crowd. We are Thailand’s first digital OOH company providing top-mounted LED screens. Let us discuss three types of advertising campaigns that we can perform for you utilizing our digital technologies.'),(565,'1. Weather-based campaigns'),(566,'Weather-based advertising has been quite popular in the digital world. The whole idea is to target consumers based on their local weather conditions. Wondering how weather can impact your business engagements? Let us explain how weather can affect customer interactions with your brand.'),(567,'Imagine the city’s temperatures rising up. In such scenarios, consumers are more likely to spend on chilled coolers, a&nbsp; glass of cold coffee or a cone of ice cream. So, if you are in the food industry, you can probably use the temperature advantage to promote your products. Weather is one of the main determinants of consumer’s interaction with brands, especially when it comes to industries like food &amp; beverage, pharmaceuticals, and others.'),(568,'At Brands On Road, we have the most effective brand awareness solutions for you. As we are compatible with programmatic platforms, we enable you to display the right ads with the right context to the right audience at the right time.'),(569,'Weather-based advertising campaigns are responsive in nature. With real-time analytics, find the best ROI for your business with us. Let our taxi top screens showcase your weather-friendly ads best suitable for your business awareness.'),(570,'2. Location powered campaigns'),(571,'DOOH has been providing advertisers with new possibilities such as hyper-targeting, retargeting, and many more. Location forms an important part of DOOH advertising and allows in-depth insights into audience interaction with a DOOH ad. Leveraging geofencing along with DOOH is especially beneficial for multi-branch retailers.'),(572,'At Brands On Road, we can help you run smart ad campaigns. Our taxi screens can automatically display your advertisements whenever they enter a 500-meter radius of your store. This can help you generate store walk-ins and provide a boost to your customer engagements. It’s time to go location-friendly and hit the roads in style.'),(573,'3. Impactful campaigns for event amplifications'),(574,'It’s time to take your events where your audience is. We, at Brands On Road, can help you with strategizing the right event-based campaign for your brand. With our smart digital tools and features like geo-location trackers, our screens can showcase your promotional ads as soon as they enter the 1km radius of the event. This helps you expand the popularity of your event beyond physical bounds.'),(575,'For instance, a rider will see your ad while boarding the taxi. He/She also sees an in-car placard promoting your event. The rider scans the QR code and is redirected to the seat booking page. He/She will book the seat as per his/her preference and can save himself/herself from the hassle of standing in long queues.'),(576,'Unique DOOH campaign ideas can beef up your brand awareness initiatives. Let us help you design and display the best ad campaigns for your brand. Take a ride with'),(577,'today.'),(578,'Campaign ideas'),(579,'Digital OOH'),(580,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/0007.png'),(581,'The age of third-party cookies is coming to an end and it promises a significant change in advertising patterns. Farewell to third-party cookies would affect areas such as behavioral targeting, audience targeting, audience extension, and many more. In this article, we shall discuss the impact of the development of a cookieless world on Digital Out Of Home advertising. Let us dive deeper into facts that explain the relevance of DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.'),(582,'Elimination of third-party cookies &#8211; Is it a harbinger of new opportunities?'),(583,'It is a pretty evident fact that a cookieless world would change the way advertisers target consumers. But at the same time, it has the potential to unfold new possibilities and encourage advertisers to explore innovative ad strategies.'),(584,'In cookieless times, DOOH advertising can prove to be a profitable escape for marketers. Advertisers can always leverage contextual marketing via DOOH advertising and build their customer base and engagement. Personalization for DOOH is not on a one-to-one basis. It is more dependent on localization. Hence, it is a good idea to shift your media investments to such cookieless digital platforms.'),(585,'At Brands On Road, we help you run smart campaigns and target audiences based on geo-location and peak times. We can help you target and captivate on-road audiences like never before.'),(586,'Benefits of DOOH advertising in a crumbled-cookie milieu'),(587,'Let us discuss some points that will help you understand the advantages of DOOH advertising in a cookie-free era.'),(588,'DOOH is non-intrusive and respects the privacy of your consumers.'),(589,'In today’s electronically inclined world, data privacy is one of the major priorities of all industries. And DOOH advertising practices are quite friendly with the idea of data protection. The best part about DOOH advertising is that it is totally non-invasive. It is one of those popular forms of advertising that does not need a consumer’s personal data. However, it builds powerful immersive experiences by leveraging only the common characteristics of audiences within a specific location.'),(590,'Thus, DOOH is a good advertising space to expand brand awareness and build effective customer engagements.'),(591,'DOOH offers customization to your audience without using third-party cookies'),(592,'DOOH focuses on contextual ads and you can always personalize your advertisements without the use of third-party cookies. It generally depends on first-party data. It includes location, time, and other IoT sources. This way, you can customize ads for your consumers without bothering their data. DOOH focuses on customer engagement using non-personal information. Thus, it can be a preferred marketing channel for advertisers in the coming future.'),(593,'DOOH is compatible with programmatic advertising'),(594,'There are a plethora of opportunities that programmatic DOOH tends to provide. It helps you display your ad at the right time to the right audience at the right location. It enables you to target your audience just the way you want and opens up innovative advertising options for you.'),(595,', we can help you build ad campaigns that are totally compatible with programmatic advertising. With our full taxi-based advertising, we believe in providing you with the perfect mix of online and offline advertising techniques.'),(596,'A cookieless world can’t stop you from reaching your customers!'),(597,'With DOOH, advertisers can always target their consumers in real-time and establish effective and meaningful communications with them. DOOH ads can be location-based, weather-based, or any other triggering factor concerning outdoor advertising. The execution of such campaigns does not require third-party cookies. Hence, it makes a lot of sense to invest your spending in DOOH advertising in a cookieless world.'),(598,'It’s time that your digital ads hit the road! Ensure growing customer engagements even in a cookieless age with DOOH.'),(599,'Cookieless World'),(600,'Programmatic Advertising'),(601,'Third-party Cookies. Advertising'),(602,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/0006.png'),(603,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/#:~:text=Brands%20on%20Road%20provides%20a%20simple%2C%20impactful%2C%20and,top%20mounted%20LED%20screens%20Want%20to%20know%20more%3F'),(604,'In today&#8217;s fast-paced age, the right balance for most advertised lies the mixture of traditional and digital advertising. Brands on Road does precisely that when it comes to Out of Home Advertising. It is an advertising platform that empowers brands through technologies that traditional out of home advertising do not provide. Brands on Road is challenging the Out of Home advertising landscape with its creative, impactful, and cost-effective approach. For example, the mere fact that commuters in Bangkok, Thailand spend over 60 hours in traffic annually empowers Brands on Road to provide advertisers with some of the most effective and efficient DOOH advertising.\n\nBrands on Road leverages this commuting time of the audience to enhance awareness, engagements, and brand values with targeted advertising campaigns. The vehicles themselves become the moving billboards traversing the roads amidst consumers. Our motto says it all- &#8216;We&#8217;re Driving Your Brand to Your Customers&#8217;. As we grow the functionality and footprint of our platform, we have already had the opportunity to run pilot campaigns for the likes of FoodPanda, Mizumi, Kaidee, P&amp;G, Rabbit Finance, Toshiba, Trip(.)com, MI, Wiko et al.'),(605,'How is Brands on Road Changing the Out of Home Advertising?'),(606,'1. Beyond Billboards, Beyond Awareness!'),(607,'Brands on Road is the first advertising platform in Thailand that took a different standpoint on roads and ad campaigns. Rather than placing the ad above everyone on a giant board, it took the ads amongst the people. This move helped in building an instant brand engagement, beyond awareness, with the consumer. Brands on Road leverages one Bangkok’s commute lifelines &#8211; taxis. With an ecosystem of Taxi top screens, taxi wraps, and in-car social box, Brands on Road helps marketers incentivize engagements, create value for consumers, and generate lasting brand recall.'),(608,'2. Targeting and Reporting in Real Time'),(609,'With the pervasive nature of'),(610,'digital advertising'),(611,', the biggest criticisms of out of home advertising have been its limitations in targeting and reporting. Brands on Road addresses this problem head-on. Our dashboard allows advertisers the ability to choose between campaign types, manage targeting, view live reports, and make strategic decisions in real-time.'),(612,'3. Cost-effective, Flexible, Impactful, and Scalable Campaigns'),(613,'Buying advertising space in the middle of Sukhumvit can cost you a fortune. If you are a small brand, it would be difficult for you even to get that space. But Brands on Road makes it possible that your advertising campaign reaches there and everywhere else, for a fraction of the cost. Taxi based ads are effective and memorable. They are a lot cheaper than other traditional Out of Home advertising campaigns on prime locations. Brands on Road is a cost-effective, flexible, impactful, and scalable platform to run your advertising campaigns for your brand.'),(614,'4. Single Dashboard Management, Smart Campaigns, and Audience Interactions'),(615,'Brands on Road provides multiple advantages over conventional OOH- innovative, cost-effective, traceable, intelligent, flexible, the list goes on! The most attractive aspect of this platform, however, is the ability to package powerful campaign capabilities into an easy-to-use intuitive platform. Advertisers can go from sign-up to live campaigns on the roads in less than an hour and go live. It provides the option to upload and manage media, run smart campaigns, reach your audience, and view reports. All of this happens on a single dashboard, so it doesn&#8217;t take an expert to use it.'),(616,'Jump on board'),(617,'with us as we drive your brand to your customers.'),(618,'AdTech'),(619,'OOH'),(620,'Out of Home Advertising'),(621,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/0008.png'),(622,'https://www.plethorait.com/hello-world/'),(623,'In the present fast-paced milieu, almost everything is turning digital. A'),(624,'ccording to the Gartner Report, around 91% of the organizations are involved in some kind of digital initiative'),(625,'. It is undeniable that the advertising industry has undergone a dramatic digital transformation. Out Of Home advertising remains one of the most traditional forms of advertising. The growing influence of digitalization has taken even OOH by storm. Here we shall discuss why digital technologies play a significant role in Out Of Home Advertising. Stay with us.'),(626,'Add a digital twist to your'),(627,'efforts'),(628,'It’s time to shine digitally even on physical boundaries! Let some'),(629,'Digital Out of Home Advertising Trends'),(630,'be a part of your brand engagement game.'),(631,'You must have witnessed different kinds of DOOH advertising practices becoming very common in your everyday outdoor spaces. Some of them being a digital directory at a mall or a digital billboard at your local BTS station, interactive kiosks at public places and many others. Things involving interactive digital features always tend to grab our attention.&nbsp; Hence, integrating digital capabilities into your OOH campaigns makes sense. What are you waiting for? Fill the gaps between digital and out of home advertising and stand out of the crowd. Let'),(632,'DOOH technologies'),(633,'help you move up the ladder of advertising brilliance.'),(634,'We, at'),(635,', believe in helping you reach your audience in the best ways. We bring digitally enabled ad deployment, targeting, and performance tracking&nbsp; capabilities to help you keep up with the latest in outdoor advertising technology. Let us get rid of the unnecessary divide between traditional OOH advertising and cutting edge'),(636,'ad tech'),(637,'methods.'),(638,'Connect with us today!'),(639,'Let your OOH initiatives find a home in digital advancements'),(640,'Audiences want quick interactions these days. Digital Out Of Home Technologies can not only help you catch eye-grabbing attention of your potential audience, but also seamlessly drive them to engagements and conversions. Given the fact that digital consumption demands are growing each day, brands are making a positive shift towards'),(641,'DOOH technology trends'),(642,'. According to a report,'),(643,'DOOH advertising will reach US$26.9 billion by 2025.'),(644,'So, think no more! Let us strengthen your OOH advertising with the right integration of digitalization. We are Thailand’s first digital OOH company to provide taxi top-mounted LED screens.'),(645,'Why merge digital with OOH?'),(646,'Let us discuss some of the key benefits of amalgamating traditional OOH with digital innovations.'),(647,'First of all, digital technologies empower your customers to interact with your content and take immediate action. Static posters or billboards will soon be a thing of the past. A pinch of digitization can provide your brand with an engagement boost.'),(648,'Secondly, tech-powered OOH is more data-oriented in nature. This, in turn, gives way to a better analysis of your ad performance. Leveraging digital and tech-enabled OOH can help navigate across relevant customer targeting features like demographics, location, time of day, and more. This enables you to optimize your advertising campaigns better. With Brands On Road, you can find the best blend of digital tools and OOH advertising. You can connect, track and manage your campaign from a single dashboard. Deploy real-time ads with us. To know more,'),(649,'click here'),(650,'Thirdly, one of the best parts about incorporating digital elements into OOH advertising is that it is cost-effective. Yes, switching to DOOH advertising won’t burn holes in your pocket. In fact, with us, you can run various ads and campaigns in a single cost-effective budget.'),(651,'Sounds cool? Let your OOH advertising ideas leverage the power of digital advancements.'),(652,'Start your Digital OOH advertising journey towards brand awareness and growth with Brands on Road.'),(653,'Digital'),(654,'Digital Out of Home Technologies'),(655,'DOOH Technology Trends'),(656,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Artboard-3-copy-3.png'),(657,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/digital-in-ooh-1024x683.jpg'),(658,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Digital-And-OOH-1024x683.jpg'),(659,'https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/insights/digitalization'),(660,'https://finance.yahoo.com/news/global-digital-home-dooh-market-150000215.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYmluZy5jb20v&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAABb5fjmWKKoIg8i1e6xc-WJVFI-CRV5kegWJoX81jdSjJSHskIBbpmUIvB9vFIwdh9jQALcPr71M1pEVuhjSV7jM1JV1mWp-aKWm6tiHBz_LLsNwfJgD7nlD797bCzXamE_Fsyg-qFNgVowuimZLGW6Xxlj1PLcMC_3bs6PDz0_v'),(661,'Did you know Bangkok was marked the'),(662,'world’s 10th most traffic-congested city in 2020'),(663,'? Studies show that commuters in Bangkok spend more than 60 hours in road traffic annually. So why not leverage the traffic factor to level up your communication game with your potential audience?&nbsp; Yes, you heard it right.'),(664,'can be one of the high-impact advertising mediums to top your brand engagement strategies. Let’s discuss how'),(665,'Bangkok'),(666,'roads can be your go to advertising space when it comes to beefing up your brand awareness.'),(667,'Weave your brand awareness with DOOH in Bangkok'),(668,'Wondering as to how Digital'),(669,'Out Of Home Advertising in Bangkok'),(670,'can perform wonders for your business? Fret not! We can help you understand the best benefits of leveraging DOOH (Digital Out Of Home) advertising in Bangkok. Read on.'),(671,'Brand boost with road traffic &#8211;'),(672,'Digital Out Of Home'),(673,'Advertising in Bangkok'),(674,'As discussed earlier, Bangkok is one of the most congested places in the world. This means that for several hours every day, your potential customers are out and stuck in traffic. This is the reason why Thailand has been witnessing one of the most rapid growths in outdoor advertising spend. Thus, leveraging the power of DOOH, especially in Bangkok, can work wonders for you. It can help you gain abundant awareness and traction for your business.'),(675,'Research suggests that the Global'),(676,'DOOH market will reach around $8,393.3 million by 2023'),(677,'. You can use DOOH strategies to reach your customers in times when they are looking for mediums to distract themselves from the traffic chaos. Sounds good?'),(678,', can help you win your DOOH objectives in Bangkok. We can provide you with a clear, simple and impactful medium to engage with your consumers.'),(679,'Reimagine your brand awareness with a city that loves media consumption'),(680,'According to a digital report, around'),(681,'74% of Thais are active social media users'),(682,'. Some of the most loved digital platforms in'),(683,'Thailand'),(684,'are YouTube, Facebook and Line.&nbsp; Due to escalating social media consumption, online advertising has also witnessed a good amount of growth and will continue to do so in the near future. Given the love for digital content consumption among Thai consumers, Bangkok becomes an essential spot to showcase your brand digitally. And DOOH in Bangkok can help you utilize the best of both worlds &#8211; outdoor advertising and digital capabilities. Add DOOH as a core advertising channel to catalyze the communication between you and your customers.'),(685,'Utilize powerful DOOH advertising capabilities with Brands on Road in Bangkok. We have got you covered. As our motto suggests, we can ‘drive your brand to your consumers’. With taxi-top screens, taxi wraps and an exciting in-car social box, we help take your advertising game to the next level. Book your brand’s success ride with us.'),(686,'Mark your business presence in Bangkok’s booming ecosystem'),(687,'The startup ecosystem is rapidly growing in Thailand. Forbes marked'),(688,'as the 8th most emerging market of 2020.'),(689,'With all players flocking to digital-only advertising, an awesome out of home campaign can be the key differentiator for your brand..'),(690,'With us, you can integrate targeting and analysis capabilities of digital channels to your Out Of Home advertising campaigns. Generate better awareness, engagement and conversions with us. Want to understand how we can help you?'),(691,'Read here!'),(692,'Find the best strategies to build brand awareness with the key advantages that DOOH has to offer in Bangkok.&nbsp; Let us help you achieve your advertising goals. It’s time for your brand to rule the roads of'),(693,'! Let us be your wheels in your journey to success.'),(694,'To moving forward towards growth!'),(695,'Digital Out of Home Advertising in Bangkok'),(696,'Out of Home Advertising in Bangkok'),(697,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Artboard-3-copy-4.png'),(698,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/1-1024x683.jpg'),(699,'https://www.tomtom.com/en_gb/traffic-index/ranking/'),(700,'https://www.alliedmarketresearch.com/digital-out-of-home-dooh-market'),(701,'https://www.pwc.com/th/en/press-room/press-release/2019/press-release-19-08-19-en.html'),(702,'https://startupinthailand.com/top-10-reasons-to-start-a-business-in-thailand/'),(703,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/how-brands-on-road-changing-the-game/?post_id=139'),(704,'https://brandsonroad.com/th'),(705,'Complete Taxi Advertising Ecosystem'),(706,'Tue, 08 Feb 2022 05:57:36 +0000'),(707,'hourly'),(708,'https://wordpress.org/?v=5.9.1'),(709,'Bangkok is back to witnessing gridlock during peak hours as Covid measures ease across the city. It’s time that brands and marketers get ready to own the streets again with DOOH (Digital-Out-Of-Home) advertising. As per a Statista study, the global ad spending on DOOH is projected to rise to 15.9 billion US dollars by 2027. [&hellip;]'),(710,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/blog-2-1024x1024.png'),(711,'Tue, 01 Feb 2022 07:34:31 +0000'),(712,'th'),(713,'https://brandsonroad.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cropped-Brandsonroad_fav-32x32.png'),(714,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/07/09/how-iot-and-ai-are-changing-the-future-of-digital-out-of-home-advertising/'),(715,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/07/09/how-iot-and-ai-are-changing-the-future-of-digital-out-of-home-advertising/#respond'),(716,'Fri, 09 Jul 2021 12:22:02 +0000'),(717,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/?p=182'),(718,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/07/09/how-iot-and-ai-are-changing-the-future-of-digital-out-of-home-advertising/feed/'),(719,'As per a study conducted by Statista, the global programmatic ad spending reached approximately 159 billion US dollars in 2020 and was set to go beyond 150 billion by 2021. It goes without saying that programmatic advertising will witness high popularity over the next few years. Marketers and advertisers all across the world are becoming [&hellip;]'),(720,'Out-of-home advertising has surely taken a backseat given the pandemic situation across the globe. But with the growing popularity of digital inventories, there’s still a silver lining for brands to strategically place their ad campaigns in the public. Brands can utilize the increased opportunity that comes with the smart integration of digital approaches to connect [&hellip;]'),(721,'Wed, 02 Feb 2022 11:49:18 +0000'),(722,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2022/01/26/programmatic-dooh-the-future-of-outdoor-advertising/'),(723,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2022/01/26/programmatic-dooh-the-future-of-outdoor-advertising/#respond'),(724,'Wed, 26 Jan 2022 08:49:58 +0000'),(725,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/?p=232'),(726,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2022/01/26/programmatic-dooh-the-future-of-outdoor-advertising/feed/'),(727,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/11/15/the-resurgence-of-dooh-in-post-pandemic-bangkok/'),(728,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/11/15/the-resurgence-of-dooh-in-post-pandemic-bangkok/#respond'),(729,'Mon, 15 Nov 2021 09:13:08 +0000'),(730,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/?p=216'),(731,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/11/15/the-resurgence-of-dooh-in-post-pandemic-bangkok/feed/'),(732,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/10/19/why-dooh-advertising-during-the-pandemic-might-not-be-a-bad-idea/'),(733,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/10/19/why-dooh-advertising-during-the-pandemic-might-not-be-a-bad-idea/#respond'),(734,'Tue, 19 Oct 2021 07:03:05 +0000'),(735,'https://www.brandsonroad.com/?p=211'),(736,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/10/19/why-dooh-advertising-during-the-pandemic-might-not-be-a-bad-idea/feed/'),(737,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/10/03/the-future-of-dooh-advertising-in-a-cookieless-world/'),(738,'https://brandsonroad.com/th/2021/10/03/the-future-of-dooh-advertising-in-a-cookieless-world/#respond'),(